  "id": "experiencer",
  "term": "experiencer",
  "definition": "In this context, an experiencer is the person or subject in a sentence who undergoes or feels a mental or physical experience described by the verb. The term is used for the argument linked to experiencer verbs, including both mental and physical kinds.",
